---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import background2 from "../assets/soltis.jpeg";
import La_selva from "../assets/forest.jpeg";
import seed_pred from "../assets/seed_pred.jpeg";
import CB_pic from "../assets/CB.png";
import REU_pic from "../assets/trees.JPG";
import stream from "../assets/stream.png";
---

<BaseLayout title="Research">

 <section class="relative -mt-[calc(4rem+2px)] min-h-[calc(100svh-2rem)] overflow-hidden border-b border-border/60 pt-[calc(4rem+2px)] sm:min-h-[100px]">
    <Image
      src={background2}
      alt=""
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[center_65%]"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
      decoding="async"
      width={1600}
      widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1600]}
      sizes="100vw"
      format="webp"
      quality={50}
    />
    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,oklch(0.1_0.02_70_/_0.68),oklch(0.16_0.02_80_/_0.38)_46%,oklch(0.98_0.01_90_/_0.1))] dark:bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,oklch(0.08_0.01_70_/_0.78),oklch(0.08_0.01_70_/_0.52)_48%,oklch(0.08_0.01_70_/_0.18))]"
    />
    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-40 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/45 via-black/18 to-transparent"
    />

    <div class="relative mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100svh-6rem)] max-w-6xl items-center px-5 py-20 sm:min-h-[100px] sm:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl text-white drop-shadow-[0_1px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.28)]">
        <h1 class="font-serif text-[2.5rem] font-medium leading-[1.02] sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">
        Research
        </h1>
          <p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/86">
          Explore some of my past and current projects below!
          </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<section class="border-b border-border/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

      {
        La_selva && (
          <Image
            src={La_selva}
            alt="La Selva"
            class="mx-auto h-auto w-2/3 object-contain"
            width={720}
            widths={[372, 560, 720]}
            sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 560px, calc(100vw - 40px)"
            format="webp"
            quality={64}
          />
        )
      }

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
            The La Selva-Barva Metanetwork: Advancing understanding and prediction of climate vulnerability for tropical species and communities
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
             Biotic interactions play an especially important role in the structure and function of tropical forests. Species survival and distributions are changing under global climate change, leading to changes
             in the interactions between species. For my PhD dissertation, I am investigating changes in the structure and function of ecological communities in Costa Rica along a 2,900m elevational gradient,
             spanning {" "}
            <a
              href="https://tropicalstudies.org/portfolio/la-selva-research-station/"
              class="underline decoration-gray-400/60 hover:decoration-gray-400"
            > 
            La Selva Biological Station
            </a>
            , Braulio Carrillo National Park, and Volcán Barva.
          </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <a
              href="https://space-lab-msu.github.io/LaSelvaMetaNetwork.github.io/"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-black pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-black hover:border-black/70 hover:text-black/82"
            >
              Project website
              <Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" />
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

 </section>

<section class="border-b border-border/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
            The Scale-Dependent Relationships of Fruiting Plants and Frugivores in Tropical Andes Forests
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
             Plant-frugivore mutualisms are a major driver to biodiversity patterns in the tropics. However, most studies overlook such interactions in biodiversity assessments, by 
             focusing on one metric of biodiversity (taxonomic diversity). In this study, I am analyzing patterns in spatial scale-dependent relationships of taxonomic and functional diversity 
             for fruiting plants and frugivorous birds and mammals in the Tropical Andes to explore how multi-faceted and multi-scale approaches can improve conservation planning in biodiversity
             hotspots.
          </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <a
              href=" "
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-black pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-black hover:border-black/70 hover:text-black/82"
            >
              (Manuscript in prep)
              <Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" />
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </section>



<section class="border-b border-border/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

      {
        seed_pred && (
          <Image
            src={seed_pred}
            alt="Seed Predation"
            class="mx-auto h-auto w-2/3 object-contain"
            width={720}
            widths={[372, 560, 720]}
            sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 560px, calc(100vw - 40px)"
            format="webp"
            quality={64}
          />
        )
      }

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Seed Bank Predation as a Driver to Plant Population Dynamics
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
             Seed bank dynamics are important for the persistence of many herbaceous plant species in pyrogenic ecosystems. At {" "}
            <a
              href="https://www.archbold-station.org/programs/plant-ecology/"
              class="underline decoration-gray-400/60 hover:decoration-gray-400"
            > 
            Archbold Biological Station
            </a>
            , I conducted a field study investigating the interplay between time-since-fire and the seed predation of five endemic plant species. 
          </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <a
              href=" "
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-black pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-black hover:border-black/70 hover:text-black/82"
            >
              (Manuscript in prep)
              <Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" />
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </section>


<section class="border-b border-border/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Long-term Human Perturbations on the Chesapeake Bay
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            I studied the salinatization and alkalinization of freshwater within the Chesapeake Bay watershed utilizing the {" "}
            <a
              href="https://datahub.chesapeakebay.net/"
              class="underline decoration-gray-400/60 hover:decoration-gray-400"
            >
            EPA Chesapeake Bay Program water quality monitoring network
            </a>
            .
          </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <a
              href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10533-025-01219-6"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-black pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-black hover:border-black/70 hover:text-black/82"
            >
              Read "Freshwater faces a warmer and saltier future from headwaters to coasts: climate risks, saltwater intrusion, and biogeochemical chain reactions"
              <Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" />
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

        {
      CB_pic && (
        <Image
          src={CB_pic}
          alt="CB"
          class="mx-auto h-auto w-full object-contain"
          width={1200}
          widths={[640, 960, 1200]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 560px, calc(100vw - 40px)"
          format="webp"
          quality={64}
        />
      )
    }

      </article>

    </div>

  </section>


 <section class="border-b border-border/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

      {
        REU_pic && (
          <Image
            src={REU_pic}
            alt="REU"
            class="mx-auto h-auto w-2/3 object-contain"
            width={720}
            widths={[372, 560, 720]}
            sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 560px, calc(100vw - 40px)"
            format="webp"
            quality={64}
          />
        )
      }

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Soil Characteristic Response with Trees to Topographic Variation in a Premontane Rainforest
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            Under Texas A&M's {" "}
            <a
              href="https://costaricareu.tamu.edu/"
              class="underline decoration-gray-400/60 hover:decoration-gray-400"
            >
            "Ecohydrology of Tropical Montane Forests – Diversity in Science, Interdisciplinary Breadth, and Global Awareness" NSF-REU
            </a>
            , I studied the relationships between topography, soil characteristics, and tree presence and distribution using spatial mapping in a Costa Rican rainforest. 
          </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <a
              href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2023AGUFM.B13K2058B/abstract"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-black pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-black hover:border-black/70 hover:text-black/82"
            >
              See project abstract
              <Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" />
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>

  </section>

<section class="border-b border-border/60">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16">
      <article class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Mesohabitat Affinities of Benthic Macroinvertebrates in Protected Lowland Rainforest Streams
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
            I quantified changes in community structure of macroinvertebrate species and functional feeding groups across stream mesohabitats (pools, glides, riffles, and rapids)
            in southeastern Nicaragua to inform biomonitoring and conservation efforts in a region with rapidly degrading aquatic ecosystems.
          </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          <a
              href="https://www.journals.uchicago.edu/doi/full/10.1086/733242?casa_token=VfEqCoJfcGQAAAAA%3A19LlunPIchCeAtdldBLwpI2RPwx-sV1UbG4SroT5mUEi5QaNSW_9jNlmSXDONDBHDFiL82UkZWI"
              class="group inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-black pb-1 text-sm font-medium text-black hover:border-black/70 hover:text-black/82"
            >
              Read "Mesohabitat affinities of benthic macroinvertebrates in protected lowland rainforest streams of southeast Nicaragua"
              <Icon name="arrow-right" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" />
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

        {
      stream && (
        <Image
          src={stream}
          alt="Stream"
          class="mx-auto h-auto w-2/3 object-contain"
          width={720}
          widths={[372, 560, 720]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 560px, calc(100vw - 40px)"
          format="webp"
          quality={64}
        />
      )
    }

      </article>

    </div>

  </section>


</BaseLayout>


